WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:04.000
Marquee. Every listing, marketed like a luxury listing.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.000
It lives inside ONE Brain, next to the rest of your business.

00:09.500 --> 00:14.400
Walk in with the presentation built, and comps that are yours.

00:14.900 --> 00:19.400
Walk the home room by room, notes and photos as you go.

00:19.900 --> 00:24.800
Won it? Add the address and photos. Marquee builds the rest.

00:25.300 --> 00:30.800
Your whole campaign, already built: packet, flyer, open house kit, social, reel and more.

00:31.300 --> 00:35.800
A reel, ready to post. Read it and approve it.

00:36.300 --> 00:41.400
Nothing posts until you approve it and switch it on.

00:41.900 --> 00:46.000
Coming soon: straight to Instagram and Facebook.

00:46.500 --> 00:51.200
At the open house, every sign-in ranked hot, warm or cool.

00:51.700 --> 00:56.600
Let your seller watch it live: who's in, and what they're asking.

00:57.100 --> 01:01.600
Then tell them how it went, in one tap.

01:02.100 --> 01:07.000
Answer six questions on Friday. The seller report writes itself.

01:07.500 --> 01:12.000
Three things need you this week. About twelve minutes.

01:12.500 --> 01:17.200
Marquee. Every listing, launched. Part of ONE.
